export anchor GarmentLabelsStyle:
    number: 109
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Garment labels
    idea: Projects hang from a clothes rail as woven labels, numbers are size tags, the greeting is a kraft swing tag, and every status is a care symbol sewn on a satin strip.
    base: light
    palette:
        closetWall: #f0eeea, the page
        navyWeave: #1f2a44, the neck label header, navy labels, size tags, text and the chart
        creamWeave: #f4ecd8, the nav strip, cream labels, the chart label and label text on navy
        redWeave: #8e1f2b, the primary button, the overdue tag and the Behind label
        satin: #fbfbf9, care strips, the activity label and the sheet
        kraft: #d9c3a0, the greeting swing tag with #2b2117 text
        goldThread: #c9b98f, frames around numbers on navy and the focus halo
        green: #2e6a45, the On track care mark
        amber: #8a5200, the At risk care mark
        greyPrint: #4f4f52, satin label print and meta
    type:
        Two stacks. Labels use Avenir Next Condensed, Roboto Condensed,
        Arial Narrow, Helvetica Neue, Arial with font-stretch condensed,
        mostly uppercase and tracked 0.06 to 0.26em. Text uses Helvetica
        Neue, Helvetica, Arial, system-ui. The swing tag title is 40px
        condensed caps, size numbers 44px, label titles 18px caps, the
        brand 26px caps tracked 0.26em, section heads 15px caps tracked
        0.24em, body 15px at 1.5.
    layout:
        The header is a woven navy neck label with a gold framed spaced caps
        brand and star, a cream search, a red New project button, a gold
        outlined bell and a cream MO square. The nav is a cream strip of caps
        cells split by dashed seams, the current cell navy. The top row pairs
        a kraft swing tag with clipped left corners and a punched hole,
        holding the date, Hello, Mara, a line about the collection and a
        dashed Care note with an iron icon saying 4 tasks are overdue, with
        four woven size tags, three navy and one red, each a gold framed
        number over a caps label. On the rail shows a grey metal rod with
        six tall narrow labels hanging from wire loops, alternating navy,
        cream and red, each with a darker fold at the top, the caps name,
        department, a boxed percent like a size, a woven progress bar, Tasks
        and Due rows, and a satin care strip sewn at the bottom with the care
        symbol and status word. Below, a cream jacquard label with stitched
        ends holds the chart, hatched bars for last week and solid navy bars
        for this week, and a long satin care label with a pinked bottom edge
        lists the activity centred. Below 1100px labels go three across,
        below 640px two.
    spacing: An 8px unit. Labels pad 16 to 22px, 16px between labels on the rail.
    density: Medium. Six tall narrow labels in one row on wide screens.
    corners: Square cut fabric. The swing tag has clipped corners and a punched hole, hanger loops are round.
    borders: 1.5px gold or cream frames around numbers, dashed seam lines where strips are sewn on, a woven weft texture on labels.
    shadows: None, except a 1px lift on the satin label.
    icons:
        Laundry care style marks at about 22 by 18px. A square with a filled
        dot for On track, an outlined triangle with a mark for At risk, a
        filled tub with a down arrow for Behind and an iron for overdue,
        always beside the caps word.
    focus: A 2px navy outline offset 3px inside a 6px gold halo. On navy the outline is cream.
    tone: Clothing label words, such as On the rail, Care note and Care and content.
